    "id": "fix-macos-godot-extract",
    "subject": "Fix downloadEngine failing to find Godot binary on macOS",
    "status": "pending",
    "description": "engine.js downloadEngine filters extracted files with isFile() and startsWith('Godot'). On macOS the extracted item is Godot.app (a directory), not a file, so godotPath is null. Fix: on macOS look for binary inside Godot.app/Contents/MacOS/Godot.",
    "blocking": [],
    "blockedBy": [],
    "effort": "small",
    "category": "bug",
    "acceptance": [
      "godot-dev download-engine on macOS finds binary at Godot.app/Contents/MacOS/Godot",
      "godotPath is written to config correctly",
      "Windows and Linux behavior unchanged"
    ],
    "edge_cases": [
      "App bundle path may vary between Godot versions"
    ]
  }
